E0201 [Error] 374..374 this value has no name — `let a, b = 1, 2` (the bare tuple) is not wolf
    note a comma groups complete bindings, each with its own `=`: `let a = 1, b = 2`. To unpack one value into several names, destructure with parens on both sides: `let (a, b) = (1, 2)`.
